# Generated asset/report OUTPUTS. The scripts that produce them live in
# scripts/assets/ and are tracked; the artefacts themselves are regenerable and
# shouldn't bloat history. The app icon and splash screens that actually ship are
# committed under ios/App/App/Assets.xcassets/, not here.
/appstore-screenshots/
/icon_preview.png
/splash_preview.png
/GigTrotter-Status-Report.pdf
/test-report.pdf
